    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trung: Yeah, my, I grew up \nin Calgary and my family,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49260,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " went to Vancouver when I was like \nnine years old. It's a funny story. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53640,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both my parents are Vietnamese refugees, actually \nAs you said, you're from Montreal.  "
